== the guard's own Cloud Run not in unguarded: refused, nothing set
Error: a: the guard runs or reads through run.googleapis.com on p, which it must never cap, zero or disable: name each in the account's `unguarded`
== BigQuery on an export's project not in unguarded: refused, nothing set
Error: a: the guard runs or reads through bigquery.googleapis.com on p, which it must never cap, zero or disable: name each in the account's `unguarded`
== a slice missing from allow: the config refused
Error: nix/google.nix: a: `allow` names no "LLM": each slice's day and month, 0 for none
== a credit drawn that nix/google.nix does not name stops the tick
Error: a: the export draws on credits ["c2"] with no `credits` entry in nix/google.nix
